  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kvinna till Kvinna 11-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pales women Seek Greater Power 11-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kvinnors deltagande i det       offentliga och politiska livet. St&#xf6;det kanaliseras till 10 enskilda   organisationer som arbetar med kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter p&#xe5; V&#xe4;stbanken och i Gaza. Kapacitetsutveckling till och n&#xe4;tverkande mellan dessa        organisationer &#xe4;r en del av programmet..</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to increase women&apos;s participation in public and   political life through support to diverse women&apos;s organising,         securing their equal contribution to civil society role in democratic state- and peace building. The support is directed to 10 women        organisation in West Bank and Gaza. Capacity development to and       networking between these organisations are also part of the programme</narrative>
  </description>
